    "name": "📌 DeepSeek API",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"DeepSeek is an AI research company focused on building world-leading general artificial intelligence.\"\n\nDeepSeek builds its own open-weight DeepSeek models and serves them through OpenAI-compatible Chat and Responses APIs. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- DeepSeek Account: [https://platform.deepseek.com/](https://platform.deepseek.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `deepseek_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:deepseek_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://api-docs.deepseek.com/](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/)\n    \n- Models: [https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing)",
